  - `data/external/pellett_valbuena_2025/04_som/.gitkeep`.

Documentation, figures, tables, manifests, environment records, and generated artifacts are not included in this definition of “Software.”

For the listed R files, the MIT grant applies only to project-authored portions.

`code/R/03_source_data_prep.R` and `code/R/04_pellett_valbuena_replication.R` implement selected Pellett & Valbuena procedures in R; they do not reproduce the complete Julia workflow. Their provenance and source citations are documented in `PELLETT_VALBUENA_WORKFLOW.md` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. Any upstream material remains subject to its own terms and outside the MIT grant. Those terms do not alter the standard MIT grant for Kyle Turchick’s project-authored R expression.

