## 3. Materials outside both project license grants

Exactly the 407 input paths listed in `data/INPUT_MANIFEST.csv` are outside both project license grants. They are redistributed in reliance on the CC BY 4.0 treatment declared by the cited Pellett–Valbuena Zenodo records and retain the source attribution described in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. Both records declare CC BY 4.0 for their deposits; this project did not independently reconstruct every upstream permission. This project does not claim ownership of or sublicense those inputs.

The project license grants also do not cover embedded Shannon values or other upstream factual material, upstream source expression, quotations, trademarks, or other third-party rights not controlled by Kyle Turchick. Inclusion of a file within the MIT-defined Software does not relicense any such material contained in that file.

